@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
actor Teller
actor Customer
rectangle "Bank Management System" {
usecase "Log in" as Login
usecase "Change password" as Password
usecase "Open account" as UC0
usecase "Update customer details" as UC1
usecase "Search customer or account" as UC2
usecase "Record deposit" as UC3
usecase "Record withdrawal" as UC4
usecase "View own accounts and balance" as UC5
usecase "Transfer funds" as UC6
usecase "View transaction history" as UC7
usecase "Download statement" as UC8
}
Teller -- Login
Customer -- Login
Teller -- Password
Customer -- Password
Teller -- UC0
Teller -- UC1
Teller -- UC2
Teller -- UC3
Teller -- UC4
Customer -- UC5
Customer -- UC6
Customer -- UC7
Customer -- UC8
note bottom
All banking use cases require authentication and their applicable role and business rules.
end note
@enduml
